# Spike 22d demo, played: after the title card (3 s), select the base,
# pick a generator, and drag out a block: the ghosts show the grid as it
# grows. Let go and the engineers build it, site after site, going round
# the generators already up.
at 3.5 drag 450,200 1150,700            # the base: a factory and two engineers
at 3.7 expect selected >= 3
at 4.2 key Z                            # the economy tab
at 4.4 key W                            # a generator
at 4.8 press 930,540
at 5.2 move 980,570
at 5.6 move 1030,610
at 6.0 move 1070,650
at 6.4 shot dragging                    # the grid it will lay out
at 6.8 release 1070,650
at 7.0 expect sent build >= 9
at 7.2 expect busy == 0
at 10.0 shot building
at 16.0 shot halfway
at 24.0 shot done
at 25.0 quit
